{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hive and Seek is a side-scrolling strategy base-building game where you clear space stations infested with monsters. By rallying robots and clearing rooms from all kinds of danger, you will be able to destroy hives and recapture the station piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/bc64c1ac863686c210ce5b59cc432603.avif?t=1772140536\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A number of stations under your supervision got infected with a strange space monster and you lost contact with the crew, your mission is to get back to the station and reclaim it by destroying every monster hive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the room and Salvage resources from the ruins of your station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/aba793259fe9ff1801ff8bbca12add13.poster.avif?t=1772140536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/aba793259fe9ff1801ff8bbca12add13.webm?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/aba793259fe9ff1801ff8bbca12add13.mp4?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your defenses and Repair your buildings to recapture the station. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/8b1d2df77952986c53b5c54bb48a9eb1.poster.avif?t=1772140536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/8b1d2df77952986c53b5c54bb48a9eb1.webm?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/8b1d2df77952986c53b5c54bb48a9eb1.mp4?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct, Rally, and Deploy your army of robots to fend off monster waves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/c7b4e119c34c3e99681f7ae732112254.poster.avif?t=1772140536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/c7b4e119c34c3e99681f7ae732112254.webm?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/c7b4e119c34c3e99681f7ae732112254.mp4?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate and hunt down monster hives to finally rid the station of their control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/1ae118f3f9a4241d77e9f8b9709cabb1.poster.avif?t=1772140536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/1ae118f3f9a4241d77e9f8b9709cabb1.webm?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/extras/1ae118f3f9a4241d77e9f8b9709cabb1.mp4?t=1772140536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Reclame your station room by room </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Fight waves and waves of unique Monsters inhabiting your station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Fix key infrastructure to build your army of robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Defend your base by building &amp; placing your robots on walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Randomized Station every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b 60-90 minutes sessions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2193110?t=1772140536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2193110?t=1772140536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772140536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772140536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hive and Seek is a side-scrolling strategy base-building game where you clear space stations infested with monsters. By rallying robots and clearing rooms from all kinds of danger, you will be able to destroy hives and recapture the station piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b